      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-enhancing-engagement-act-2023.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "The amendment of section 7 of the Freedom of Information Act 1982\nmade by this Schedule applies in relation to the following:\n\n(a) a request for access, made under section 15 of that Act, that\nis received on or after the day the final report of the Defence\nand Veteran Suicide Royal Commission is submitted to the\nGovernor-General;\n\n(b) an application, made under section 48 of that Act, that is\nreceived on or after the day the final report of the Defence\nand Veteran Suicide Royal Commission is submitted to the\nGovernor-General.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 15 February 2023\nSenate on 9 March 2023]\n\n(7/23)",
